title Cassette LOAD animation, frame 5 of 5 (750 ms): landed (with its 4 px bounce at 540 ms); the name Take 007 is half written onto the label; the strip says TAKE 007; the hubs stay still
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 75
env CASSETTE_ANIM_FPS 60
env CASSETTE_LOAD_STEP_MS 10
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
key up
wait 200
key l
wait 1850
shot load-t750ms
@480x320 expect text "TAKE 007 · 48k/16 WAV · 12 h 40 left"
expect text "Take 007"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
